            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Tài Tử",
            "review_text": "美英\n6 contributions\n1\nThe experience of the talented restaurant.\nOct 2023 • Friends\nThis trip to Vietnam with friends brought me many beautiful memories. Among them, this restaurant in the southwest of Vietnam has a very good impression on me. The food here is very suitable for my taste, the service quality is quite good, and the waiters are particularly enthusiastic. The restaurant is spacious and beautifully decorated. In addition, I learned that the chef of the restaurant is a real Westerner, but the food is adjusted to the taste of central people. In particular, I heard amateur music here - Tan Ge Le Cai Zi. They also introduced singers and musicians from the southwest of Vietnam. They are very friendly and sing very well.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten October 7, 2023\nNhà hàng Tài Tử\nDear Mr/Ms 美英 \n\nWarm grettings from the Tai Tu restaurant,\nThank you for giving us a perfect rating and taking the time to write this feedback.\n\nWe are genuinely focused on wanting to create the best experience and the best food possible for our customers. So that we are pleased to know that you enjoyed everything at our restaurant from the food to the customer service. Our staff members take their roles in this industry very seriously in order to provide the best quality food and service. Therefore, we are overjoyed to hear that your dining with us has met your expectations.\n\nThank you again for your feedback and we look forward to welcoming you back during your next trip to Da Nang!\n\nYour Sincerely,\nTai Tu Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten October 7, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
