            "review_text": "David Smith\nUnited States2 contributions\n1\nGood quality food, fine service and not overly priced\nSep 2023 • Business\nIt s a big restaurant, but all the meal were delicious. The waiter was great and showed us how to eat some specialities. There is a huge choice of various meals. Great experience!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 24, 2023\nNhà hàng Tài Tử\nDear Mr/Ms David\n\nWarm grettings from the Tai Tu restaurant,\nThank you for giving us a perfect rating and taking the time to write this feedback.\n\nWe are genuinely focused on wanting to create the best experience and the best food possible for our customers. So that we are pleased to know that you enjoyed everything at our restaurant from the food to the customer service. Our staff members take their roles in this industry very seriously in order to provide the best quality food and service. Therefore, we are overjoyed to hear that your dining with us has met your expectations.\n\nThank you again for your feedback and we look forward to welcoming you back during your next trip to Da Nang!\n\nYour Sincerely,\nTai Tu Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
