            "review_text": "jackson\nUnited States1 contribution\n1\nAmateur restaurant\nSep 2023 • Friends\nWhat impressed me when I came to the restaurant was the super beautiful space and western-style decoration. In Da Nang, there are very few shops with this type of decor and I really like the service of the staff there. The service is very attentive, warm, and supports customers when they encounter difficulties. What's even more special is the staff. very pretty mn . The next plus point is the food: my table ordered long dang (fried strabismic fish), pangasius fish dipped in vinegar, and also ordered sien xe (braised scorched rice), all 3 dishes are very suitable for everyone's taste. , although the price is a bit higher than other restaurants but it is worth the money. Please try this restaurant, I guarantee you won't be disappointed\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten September 21, 2023\nNhà hàng Tài Tử\nCảm ơn quý khách đã đến và ủng hộ Nhà hàng Tài Tử. Nhà hàng Tài Tử rất hận hạnh được tiếp đón và phục vụ quý khách nhiều hơn nữa ạ. Chúc quý khách và gia đình hạnh phúc và mạnh khỏe!!!\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
